---
title: Fitts's law is a feeling
date: 2026-05-21
readingTime: 4 min
dek: Good hit-targets aren't measured, they're sensed. Notes from rebuilding a toolbar three times until it felt right.
---

You can calculate the index of difficulty for a target. You can also just move
your cursor to it a hundred times and notice when your hand stops hesitating.

## The third rebuild

The first toolbar was correct. The second was compact. The third one felt like
it was reaching back toward my cursor — same maths, different spacing rhythm.
That's the one that shipped.
